//     (the interior part puts stairs there). The upper-floor surface is walk-at y=6.
//  5. PARTITION x=9, z=12..18, y=2..4 and y=6..7 (y=5 is the floor) in BOARD (spruce_planks). Doorways: leave isOpening cells unset
